  "note": "Round 8: the materials of the user's own console image. Cool blue gunmetal plates under a light from the top left, bright steel bevels and columns, dark glass windows with a thin light line, cyan-outlined LCD cells for the control groups, blue triple-chevron lamps and blue light strips. Each colour is read from the image at the piece it fills. The kit's looks stay for the menu tabs. Round 9 adds res.btn, the face of a button the game draws in a bar cell (Diplomacy, Messaging, idle, army): dark blue glass, faintly lit. Hyperion's copy: the tooltip shows and goes at once, as the original's does, so its tip.show and tip.hide timelines are left out (the user, 2026-10-23).",
